  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Brett Matsumoto said he has a great interest in improving measurement of the impact of new technologies such as artificial intelligence. Matsumoto also said he is interested in the potential use of new tools at the agency while noting challenges in a statistical agency involving non-public, personally identifiable, and pre-release data.",
